# The luckfox-pico SDK revision every Luckfox build is pinned to.
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: CI and os-build.sh both cloned the SDK with
# `git clone --depth=1 --single-branch` off the default branch -- an unpinned
# moving target. Two builds of the SAME seedsigner-os commit, a week apart,
# could therefore use different kernel sources, a different Buildroot version
# and a different prebuilt toolchain, and there was nothing in the repo that
# recorded which. That alone makes a byte-reproducible image impossible.
#
# This also pins Buildroot. Unlike the Pi/La Frite path, which carries Buildroot
# as a git submodule, the Luckfox Buildroot version is chosen by the SDK tarball
# and merely discovered at build time (resolve-buildroot-dir.sh) -- the SDK sha
# is the only handle there is.
#
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored; the first remaining line is the sha.
# Override for SDK development with LUCKFOX_COMMIT=<sha> or LUCKFOX_BRANCH=<br>.
